SoftekBarcode Perl Module version
=================================

The SoftekBarcode Perl module provides a Perl interface to the Softek Barcode
Reader Toolkit. 

INSTALLATION

IMPORTANT...

On some versions of linux you must either:

Copy ../lib/libbardecode.so to /usr/lib

e.g

sudo cp ../lib/libbardecode.so /usr/lib

OR

set LD_LIBRARY_PATH to "../lib" before testing or using the module.

e.g

LD_LIBRARY_PATH=../lib export LD_LIBRARY_PATH

To install this module type the following:

   perl Makefile.PL
   make
   make test
   make install

DEPENDENCIES

This module requires these other modules and libraries:

	Softek Barcode Reader Toolkit Version
	libtiff
	libjpeg
	libz

